    <briefdescription>
<para>Control Table and capabilities of one model. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The Indirect Address registers are not in x430_model::registers: the library generates them from the blocks (2 bytes, RW, initial value Indirect Data n, range 64 .. table_size - 1) and numbers them after the table registers, which all lie below the first block. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
